623335", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035460_8514674871956668_5536053659043017688_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=acGZOIU7G5AQ7kNvwHRmhFS&_nc_oc=Adq4bhSwJ9lciQ2cCtp8p4mJgfMQYj4wEKHnppM8Hh7QgLi5VoRg4-6tvD7SKL4qDXM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOYdylaKo523IEb6d6ebZ5GexVx9Bh9g1xbRogsBGqEEA&oe=6AC10262"}, "display_name": "RCP VR", "keywords": ["CPR", "Training", "FirstAid", "Life", "Medical"], "long_description": "Have you ever wondered how you would react in a medical emergency?\n\nImagine this: you're at work, in a shopping mall, or walking down the street, and suddenly, someone collapses next to you. Would you know what to do?\n\nAt Four Players VR, we\u2019ve developed a Virtual Reality Cardiopulmonary Resuscitation (CPR) simulation that trains you to act with confidence and effectiveness in critical situations.\n\nGet ready to save lives:\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Identify: Recognize a cardiac emergency and immediately activate the response protocol.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Execute: Learn how to properly perform CPR maneuvers, from compressions to ventilation, ensuring the best possible assistance.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Use: Become an expert in the safe and effective use of an AED (automated external defibrillator).\n\nDon\u2019t let fear paralyze you. Join us and gain the skills you need to make a difference in critical moments with Four Players VR!", "short_description": "\u2764\ufe0f Identify: Recognize a cardiac emergency and immediately activate the response protocol.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Execute: Learn how to properly perform CPR maneuvers, from compressions to ventilation, ensuring the best possible assistance.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Use: Become an expert in the safe and effective use of an AED (automated external defibrillator)."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Hero Cover 3000x900-01.png", "id": "1521375421828587", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982664_1521375425161920_9188152085567170692_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YanvBk3fiKQQ7kNvwG_WtCV&_nc_oc=AdoJmkBTktGkMmW1jjMsKlbXmEIoSVH_CymZTmxLRG41uym0Wk5g7xHZz-Qq-UHTdJA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMPuxV9OLYsir10InUx8b_E8X5KCt_uaDcTSku9XOTO7g&oe=6AC10FF3"}, {"file_name": "Cover Art Square 1440x1440-01.png", "id": "1067684668157887", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75221326_1067684671491220_581184548072541025_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ufy8e-9j7jEQ7kNvwG6DrRp&_nc_oc=AdqYSyIXUKIqDqRi4CfYrUl2YNLEvgjV9Fq-1JCgPM4nJd0E3NJTFMsxtrP765xiHes&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNfBnb5JVbp0jnRQoXTSGU1buJ_9aRmOIUUZchIvvrVhg&oe=6AC1046B"}, {"file_name": "Logo 9000x1440-01.png", "id": "875705051208789", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75339313_875705054542122_3606485636804263314_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bDzeewS8DREQ7kNvwFYVJbs&_nc_oc=AdqKdONhY1PvIlHL_axP88DKcaxmXhUgXHbPTFQaasjqMjHEBZVAnDinD2U2jPbDHT8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPNoOtm5UZKY5W38fF0K8d8GX32uui9EW8snVPaKXv4KQ&oe=6AC121A2"}, {"file_name": "Icon 512x512-01.png", "id": "581195491100081", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57568678_581195494433414_3254618470938933182_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DZTV_3c_QesQ7kNvwF_Jl8N&_nc_oc=AdpnzjF5jZLGy37HXAroYVTcvdYlt6fuBjZHv1OiZN9_CcG-tx-xrUpg6LuDNjxKZQs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQP4Tl93wdksesdzF7ysU5VbhSVysh7mcTxfhIcuCpnRWQ&oe=6AC1243D"}, {"file_name": "Cover Art Landscape 1008x1440-01.png", "id": "480126738396124", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982658_480126745062790_195688056568553292